   830                              <1> ;======NEW CODE======
   831                              <1> ;Now ensure there is no old .BAK file by deleting it. 
   832                              <1> ;If the delete fails, we proceed as normal. 
   833                              <1> ;Worst case scenario, we end up with three files, .BAK, .EXT and .$$$. 
